{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Rektangle Show</strong> is a couch-party game where you fight your friends in a <strong>CRAZY Tv Show</strong>.<br>Wield <strong>wacky</strong> weapons to <strong>REKT</strong> your opponents until you are the <strong>last rektangle standing</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, a <strong>random events strikes</strong>, causing\u00a0<strong>CHAOS</strong> in the map, forcing you to take <strong>riskier decisions</strong> and leave your <strong>comfort zone</strong>. <strong>NO CAMPING.</strong><br>And before the <strong>intermision</strong> a <strong>special event</strong> will apear, changing the way you have to <strong>play that round</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you imagine being on a TV show where you're a rectangle with eyebrows who has to crush his friends to advance and win a <i>juicy</i> and <i>exquisite</i> prize in green bills, while using very impractical and questionable-quality weapons? No? Well, what a lack of imagination, BECAUSE IN THE REKTANGLE SHOW\u2122 WE DO EXACTLY THAT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 Players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and online multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >events every single round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ 25 events and +5 events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ 25 Weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Themes with 3 maps each.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3631000?t=1770839513","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631000/64689a1ea3a594d6caf2c157afab43b1c46f4d8f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770839513","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631000/a68377fd02afe935a5ee984ed1f74eb193d2c7fc/capsule_23